        {
            "id": "20261116A09FVI00",
            "title": "浙商证券：新乳业Q3新品保持双位数占比，Q4预计有较多新品面市",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OWvsWTt0IlTQDielXn3AiFhVDPRq_Y33QbybDgHC0ZW6cAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20261116A09FVI00",
            "author": "潜力Talker",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-16 14:59:58",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"图片\" class=\"qnt-img-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img qnr-img-lazy-load-img-placeholder\" data-src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Om7kJl6WRGw05jNIqAhxlPL2GzGiYb1nqzJIuT0ECDIpoAA/641\" src=\"https://inews.gtimg.com/om_bt/Om7kJl6WRGw05jNIqAhxlPL2GzGiYb1nqzJIuT0ECDIpoAA/641\" style=\"border-radius:6px;width:100%;height:100%\"/></p><p>11月16日，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">浙商证券</span></span></span>研报指出，<strong><span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">新乳业</span></span></span>（002946.SZ）</strong>26Q3<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">毛销差</span></span></span>同比稳中有升，期待后续弹性；Q3新品保持双位数占比，26Q4预计有较多新品面市。23年公司提出的<!-- -->23-27五年规划<!-- -->，至今已持续、稳步、超预期兑现，公司当前正处于成长的快车道上。</p><p>我们认为26年乳制品板块供需格局有望优化，公司收入业绩弹性俱佳，未来三年利润率有望继续提升、打开中期利润空间、持续重点推荐。预计2026-2028年公司营业收入为118.8/127.1/137.0亿元，同比+5.8%/+6.9%/+7.8%；<!-- -->归母净利润<!-- -->8.4/10.0/11.4亿元，同比+15.0%/+18.5%/+14.6%。</p></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
